    "description": {
      "content": "The Google Chat REST API lets developers build Chat apps that send messages,\nmanage spaces and members, post cards, handle slash commands, react to\nevents, and integrate external services into Workspace conversations.\nAuthentication uses OAuth 2.0 user credentials or service-account credentials\nfor app-bot calls.\n",
